msgid ""
"The Carzyf405HD AIO has 4 PWM outputs internally connected to its 4-in-1 "
"ESC. The pads for motor output M1 to M4 are also on the board. All 4 outputs"
" support DShot, as well as all PWM types. The default configuration is for "
"DShot using the already installed BlueJay firmware."
msgstr ""
"Carzyf405HD AIO 有 4 路 PWM 输出，内部连接到其四合一电调。板上也提供电机输出 M1 至 M4 的焊盘。全部 4 路输出均支持 "
"DShot 及所有 PWM 类型。默认配置为使用已预装的 BlueJay 固件运行 DShot。"

